    "authorizationStatus": "not-applicable",
    "issuerPathway": "not-applicable",
    "foreignExceptionStatus": "not-applicable",
    "daspOfferSaleStatus": "not-applicable",
    "notes": "XAGm is described as an LBMA Good Delivery silver-backed token for collateral and trading. It is a commodity-referenced product, so GENIUS payment-stablecoin authorization is not applicable on the reviewed facts. The ozPerToken starts at one fine troy ounce and decreases through a 0.3% annual custody fee. Redemption represents silver at the prevailing ozPerToken value, not a fixed amount of national currency. The issuer-authored March 17, 2026 XAGm whitepaper does not name a legal issuer; issuerEntity remains omitted.",
